                     @plan.StoriesAndModels.V4
                     ]
        description
            Deliverable: Todo Essentials exercises recursive states, refs, operations, React,
            fixtures,
            Stories, checkpoints, and TestClock through packed supported routes.
            Allowed writes: packages/flow-state-rewrite/test/packed/todo/** only.
            Evidence: exact packed revision, commands, runtime results, and cleanup receipts;
            evidence/T604.md.
            1. Build and install the fresh rewrite package into an isolated Todo consumer.
            2. Exercise the named route flow and required actor/operation/Story journeys.
            3. Record success and one representative type/runtime rejection before side effects.
            Prerequisite rationale: T601 owns route reachability and component Tasks own semantics.
            Fixes return to capability owners; no private implementation import is permitted.
            Shared-write boundary: T604 writes the packed Todo consumer only; product and route
            changes return to their owners.
        acceptance
            Against a fresh packed package, run the Todo Essentials journey through supported 
            public routes: traverse recursive states and refs/leases, mark one Todo complete 
            through its authored accepted action, observe the accepted state transition, operation 
            result, and React view, then exercise fixtures, Story checkpoint/restore, and 
            TestClock. Include one invalid action/type case and assert it rejects before 
            actor/store mutation. No private/deep import, erased type, stale package, or alternate 
            runtime is used. Run the packed Todo consumer suite; expected: the accepted action and 
            every named journey pass, and the rejection leaves state unchanged.

